{"id": "22-1551-2-2", "zh": "数词部", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1552-2-10", "zh": "eka 一词用于数目义时，只以单数结尾；用于其他意义时，则以单数和复数结尾。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1553-2-14", "zh": "其中用于数目义的，如：ekā itthī（一个女人）、ekaṃ、ekāya、ekissā 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1553-15-20", "zh": "阳性与中性的单数形式，分别与 purisa、citta 的变化相同。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1554-2-22", "zh": "用于其他意义的，如：ekā itthī、ekā itthiyo、ekaṃ、ekā、ekāya、ekissā、ekāhi、ekābhi 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1555-2-22", "zh": "eko puriso（某个男人）、eke、ekaṃ、eke、ekena、ekehi、ekebhi、ekassa、ekesaṃ、ekesānaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1555-23-25", "zh": "都与阳性的 sabba 相同。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1556-2-13", "zh": "ekaṃ kulaṃ、ekāni kulāni、ekaṃ kulaṃ、ekāni kulāni。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1556-14-16", "zh": "其余与阳性相同。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1557-2-6", "zh": "后接 ka 词缀时，没有 sabba 类的变化形式。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1558-2-21", "zh": "“愿那个拿走你芒果的女人，独自睡在床上。〔Jā 1.4.175〕", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-1558-22-48", "zh": "我独自一人在家，受到母亲的督促。”这是圣典文句；又如 ekako puriso、ekakaṃ、ekakena。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1558-49-67", "zh": "ekakaṃ kulaṃ 等只以单数结尾；但要表达多个 ekaka 时，可以得到 dve ekakā、dve ekake、dvīhi ekakehi 这样的形式。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1558-68-83", "zh": "“般遮罗王与毗提诃王，愿你们两人合为一体。”这是圣典文句。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1558-84-88", "zh": "依照这种方式，也可以得到复数形式。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1558-89-94", "zh": "‘ekā’是兼有单复数的混合形式。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-1559-2-9", "zh": "而与否定词结合时，如：anekā itthiyo（许多女人）、anekāsaṃ itthīnaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1559-10-15", "zh": "aneke purisā、anekesaṃ purisānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1559-16-21", "zh": "anekāni kulāni、anekesaṃ kulānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1559-22-41", "zh": "而圣典中也有“nekāni dhaññagaṇāni、nekāni khettagaṇāni、nekānaṃ dhaññagaṇānaṃ、nekānaṃ khettagaṇānaṃ”（许多谷物、许多田地）这样的形式。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1560-2-11", "zh": "ekacca、ekacciya、kati、bahu 等词也应在这里说明。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1560-12-20", "zh": "ekaccā itthī（某个女人）、ekaccā、ekaccāyo，全部与 kaññā 相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1561-2-4", "zh": "ekacco puriso（某个男人）。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1562-2-14", "zh": "135. Ekaccādīhyato（在以 a 结尾的 ekacca 等词之后）〔多本作‘ekaccādīhato’〕。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-1563-2-7", "zh": "在以 a 结尾的 ekacca 等词之后，yo 变为 ṭe。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1564-2-7", "zh": "ekacce purisā、ekacce purise。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1564-8-10", "zh": "其余与 purisa 相同。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1564-11-18", "zh": "规则中的“等”字涵盖 appekacca、ekatiya、ubha 等词。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1564-19-27", "zh": "appekacce purisā、ekatiye purisā、ubhe purisā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1565-2-4", "zh": "ekaccaṃ cittaṃ（某个心）。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1566-2-8", "zh": "236. Na nissa ṭā（ni 不变为 ṭā）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1567-2-7", "zh": "在 ekacca 等词之后，ni 不变为 ṭā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1568-2-4", "zh": "ekaccāni cittāni。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1568-5-7", "zh": "其余与 citta 相同。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1569-2-12", "zh": "ekacciya、ekacceyya、ekatiya 这几个词，按 kaññā、purisa、citta 的方式变化。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1569-13-31", "zh": "“人民之主啊，确实有些女人比男人更好。〔Saṃ.ni 1.127〕", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1569-32-38", "zh": "人们说得确实没错：这世上有一些人，", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-1569-39-87", "zh": "捞起一块漂浮的木头还更好，也不要去救那些人。”〔Jā 1.1.73〕以及“被围住的某些人得以脱身”以及“不要信任某些人”，这些是圣典文句——其中‘niplavitaṃ’是指从水中捞起来的。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-1570-2-4", "zh": "kati 一词只以复数结尾。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1571-2-12", "zh": "237. Ṭikatimhā（在 kati 之后变为 ṭi）〔Rū 第 120 页〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1572-2-6", "zh": "在 kati 之后，yo 变为 ṭi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1573-2-13", "zh": "kati itthiyo（多少女人）、kati purisā、kati purise、kati cittāni。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1573-14-22", "zh": "katihi itthīhi、katihi purisehi、katihi cittehi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1574-2-15", "zh": "238. Bahukatīnaṃ（bahu 与 kati 的）〔多本作‘bahu katinnaṃ’〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1575-2-9", "zh": "在 naṃ 之前，bahu 与 kati 的末尾加上 nuk 增音。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1576-2-26", "zh": "katinnaṃ itthīnaṃ、katinnaṃ purisānaṃ、katinnaṃ cittānaṃ；这个 n 增音常常不出现，也可以见到‘katinaṃ tithīnaṃ pūraṇī katimī’（满足多少日的那一日是第几日）这样的形式。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-1576-27-69", "zh": "“bahūnaṃ vassasatānaṃ、bahūnaṃ vassasahassānaṃ”（许多百年、许多千年）以及“bahūnaṃ kusaladhammānaṃ、bahūnaṃ akusaladhammānaṃ”（许多善法、许多不善法）以及“如来们确实是为了众人的利益而出世”〔Vi.va 807〕，这些是圣典文句。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1577-2-10", "zh": "katisu itthīsu、katisu purisesu、katisu cittesu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1578-2-9", "zh": "bahu 一词在两种 naṃ 格（与格和属格）中，应说成 bahunnaṃ、bahunnaṃ。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1578-10-16", "zh": "其余与 dhenu、bhikkhu、āyu 相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1579-2-14", "zh": "后接 ka 词缀时，与 kaññā、purisa、citta 相同，如 bahū itthiyo（许多女人）、bahukā itthiyo。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1579-15-23", "zh": "bahū purisā、bahavo purisā、bahukā purisā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1579-24-31", "zh": "bahūni cittāni、bahukāni cittāni 等，应这样说。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1579-32-63", "zh": "当着眼于众多事物的整体时，也可以用单数，如圣典文句“为了大众的利益、为了大众的福祉，为了众多人的利益与福祉”〔A.ni 1.141〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1580-2-28", "zh": "ubha 一词只以复数结尾；依规则‘ubhagohi ṭo’（在 ubha 与 go 之后变为 ṭo），yo 变为 ṭo，如 ubho itthiyo、purisā、kulāni gacchanti（两个女人、两个男人、两个家族去），ubho itthiyo、purisā、kulāni passati（他看见两个女人、两个男人、两个家族）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1581-2-17", "zh": "239. Suhisubhasso（在 su、hi 之前，ubha 的末尾变为 o）〔Nī 313（Rū 第 109 页）〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1582-2-9", "zh": "在 su、hi 之前，ubha 的末尾变为 o。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1583-2-5", "zh": "ubhohi、ubhosu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1584-2-19", "zh": "240. Ubhinnaṃ〔Ka 86；Nīrū 227；Nī 341〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1585-2-6", "zh": "在 ubha 之后，naṃ 变为 innaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1586-2-3", "zh": "ubhinnaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1586-4-11", "zh": "以上各形式都应与 itthi、purisa、kula 搭配使用。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1587-2-21", "zh": "241. Yomhi dvinnaṃ duvedve（在 yo 时，dvi 变为 duve、dve）〔Ka 132；Rū 228；Ni 310〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1588-2-9", "zh": "在 yo 时，dvi 连同格尾变为 duve、dve。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1588-10-17", "zh": "规则中说‘dvinnaṃ’，是为了规定 dvi 只以复数结尾。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1589-2-29", "zh": "dve itthiyo（两个女人）、dve purisā、dve purise、dve cittāni、duve itthiyo、duve purisā、duve purise、duve cittāni、dvīhi、dvībhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1590-2-22", "zh": "242. Naṃmhi nuka dvādīnaṃ sattarasannaṃ（在 naṃ 之前，dvi 等十七个数词加 nuk）〔Ka 67；Nī 229；Nī 214〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1591-2-12", "zh": "后接 naṃ 时，从 dvi 到 aṭṭhārasa 为止的十七个数词，末尾加上 nuk 增音。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1591-13-15", "zh": "u 音是为了便于发音而加的。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1591-16-20", "zh": "看到 k 标记，就知道是加在末尾。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1592-2-3", "zh": "dvinnaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1593-2-20", "zh": "243. Duvinnaṃ naṃmhi（在 naṃ 时变为 duvinnaṃ）〔Ka 132；Rū 228；Nī 244〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1594-2-8", "zh": "在 naṃ 时，dvi 连同格尾可以变为 duvinnaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1595-2-13", "zh": "duvinnaṃ、dvīhi、dvībhi、dvinnaṃ、duvinnaṃ、dvīsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1595-14-44", "zh": "依大规则，在 su 时也变为 duve，如“由大象的两根象牙造成”〔Vi.va 706〕、“在两只脚上得到轮相”〔Dī.ni 3.205〕。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1595-45-58", "zh": "这样一来，duvehi、duvebhi 也同样成立；这个 dvi 词与 ubha 一样，不分性别。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1596-2-22", "zh": "244. Tisso catasso yomhi savibhattīnaṃ（在 yo 时，ti、catu 连同格尾变为 tisso、catasso）〔Ka 133；Rū 230；Nī 311〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1597-2-11", "zh": "在阴性中，后接 yo 时，ti、catu 连同格尾分别变为 tisso、catasso。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1598-2-7", "zh": "tisso itthiyo（三个女人）、catasso itthiyo（四个女人）。", "confidence": 90}
